        "id": "computer-networks-q1",
        "stem": "1000B分组在10Mb/s链路上传输时延是多少？",
        "options": [
          {
            "key": "A",
            "text": "0.8ms"
          },
          {
            "key": "B",
            "text": "100ms"
          },
          {
            "key": "C",
            "text": "1ms"
          },
          {
            "key": "D",
            "text": "8s"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "explanation": "1000B=8000bit；8000/10⁷秒=0.8ms。",
        "concept": "时延与吞吐量",
        "difficulty": "基础"
      },
      {
        "id": "computer-networks-q2",
        "stem": "192.168.10.130/26所在子网的网络地址是？",
        "options": [
          {
            "key": "A",
            "text": "192.168.10.0"
          },
          {
            "key": "B",
            "text": "192.168.10.128"
          },
          {
            "key": "C",
            "text": "192.168.10.130"
          },
          {
            "key": "D",
            "text": "192.168.10.192"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "explanation": "/26每块64地址，130落在128至191内，网络地址128。",
        "concept": "IPv4与子网",
        "difficulty": "基础"
      },
      {
        "id": "computer-networks-q3",
        "stem": "常规/26 IPv4多主机子网可用主机数为？",
        "options": [
          {
            "key": "A",
            "text": "64"
          },
          {
            "key": "B",
            "text": "32"
          },
          {
            "key": "C",
            "text": "62"
          },
          {
            "key": "D",
            "text": "30"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "explanation": "主机位6，2⁶-2=62，排除网络及广播地址。",
        "concept": "IPv4与子网",
        "difficulty": "基础"
      },
      {
        "id": "computer-networks-q4",
        "stem": "远端目的不在本地子网时，主机通常ARP查询谁？",
        "options": [
          {
            "key": "A",
            "text": "远端目的主机"
          },
          {
            "key": "B",
            "text": "DNS服务器"
          },
          {
            "key": "C",
            "text": "所有路由器"
          },
          {
            "key": "D",
            "text": "默认网关"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "explanation": "链路上要送到下一跳网关，ARP解析网关IP的MAC。",
        "concept": "ARP与转发",
        "difficulty": "基础"
      },
      {
        "id": "computer-networks-q5",
        "stem": "路由表转发查找采用什么原则？",
        "options": [
          {
